The first civilization is arranged as a gradual progression.

Outer Region

The player begins around the outskirts of the civilization.

This region contains:

- Desert
- Camel routes
- Small settlements
- Workers
- Traders
- Basic buildings

Settlement

The player reaches a larger ancient settlement.

Here he encounters:

- Shops
- NPCs
- Workers
- Children
- Camel owners
- Traders
- Ancient clothing
- Ancient objects

Royal Region

Further exploration leads toward the royal area.

This region contains:

- Royal buildings
