20. Final Chapter Identity

CHAPTER II — THE VESTIGE OF ANTEDILUVIAN DOMINION

The chapter's core themes are:

Ancient Civilization + Exploration + Mystery + Comedy + Horror + History + Timeline + Pyramids + Communication + Player Choice

The chapter is designed to feel like the player has entered a living ancient world rather than simply visiting a historical location.

